                "text": "Being your Governor has been the biggest honor of my life. We've seen billions invested in roads, economy, schools, hospitals, and tourism.\n\nI sleep well at night knowing that little ole West Virginia FINALLY has a seat at the table, and we should all be incredibly proud! https://t.co/kE6J6JxASI",
